# Workspace & API

## Monorepo

- Package manager: **pnpm** workspaces (`artifacts/*`, `lib/*`, `scripts`)
- On Windows: `pnpm install --ignore-scripts` (root preinstall needs Unix `sh`)
- Typecheck: `pnpm run typecheck` · Build: `pnpm run build`

## API stack

- **NestJS** (`artifacts/api-server`) — global prefix `/api`; all admin routes at `/api/v1/admin/`
- **Firebase Firestore** via `lib/firebase` (Admin SDK; returns empty arrays if unconfigured)
- **Auth guard:** `FirebaseAuthGuard` + `AdminRoleGuard` — both must be present on admin controller
- **No PostgreSQL / Drizzle** — Firestore is the only data store

## Alignment with admin-web

- Admin-web fetches from `api-server` using `fetch()` with Bearer token
- API returns raw Firestore document shapes (no transformation layer)
- `FirestoreCollections` constants from `@workspace/firebase` must be used — no hardcoded string collection names
- After API changes: run `pnpm --filter @workspace/api-server run typecheck` to verify
